AstroM2_6_2 =
"\cF****************************************************************************************\n"
"\cD65 FC: Project Charon continues to transmit, despite Earth not answering. The scientists of Project Charon, every single one of them people of "
"unshakeable faith and immense intellect, still shielded by the organic layer, take the decision to research until their final breath. Once "
"Project Charon's life support can no longer sustain them, their final burst containing everything they've learned will be sent to the "
"Satellite Network, where it will bounce among every satellite with a receiving antenna until none are left.";

AstroM2_6_3 =
"\cF****************************************************************************************\n"
"\cD66 FC: The Divine Frequency resumes motion, finally stopping at four million kilometers from Mars' orbit. The final burst is sent from Project Charon. In it, "
"all discoveries related to Psykhus, PSI, mutation, alteration, along with blueprints on how to filter Divine Frequency interference and harness some of its "
"byproducts, discovered on a last ditch effort to ''silence the dead'', are left to roam Earth's orbit in the Satellite Network, in hopes that "
"they will save anyone.";

AstroM2_6_4 =
"\cF****************************************************************************************\n"
"\cD67 FC:  Mars is engulfed by the Divine Frequency. The experimental subjects and Enlightened trapped in the Cult's labs regulate their population through "
"cannibalism, and when power starts failing, all locks are released. Mutated subjects, deranged Enlightened, altered beings roam the Underhalls, "
"coming in contact with the Mushrooms, with one another, and with the now constant assault of the Frequency's closeness to Earth. With nothing stopping "
"them from doing so, a large portion of them return to the surface.";

AstroM2_6_5 =
"\cF****************************************************************************************\n"
"\cD85 FC: The surface can no longer sustain human life. Plant life is twisted and altered under the barrage of the Perimeter. Animal life mutates "
"at an alarming rate, chaotically reshaping itself into whatever their flesh can contain. Enlightened become the majority, split into tribes "
"across the globe, each led by a Champion that has ''seen God''.";

AstroM2_6_6 =
"\cF****************************************************************************************\n"
"\cD109 FC: The Divine Frequency stops just short of the Moon's orbit. No stars are visible from Earth. The sun disappears. A bluish glow covers the Earth, "
"irradiating from the perimeter with no discernible direction. Chronicle ends here.\n\n"
"Demiurge, signing off.";

